19. Transaction

Conceptueel:

BEGIN;

INSERT INTO credentials (...);

INSERT INTO events (
    event_type,
    aggregate_type,
    aggregate_id,
    actor_id,
    payload
)
VALUES (
    'CREDENTIAL_ISSUED',
    'credential',
    :credential_id,
    :actor_id,
    :payload
);

COMMIT;

Credential en audit-event worden dus atomair opgeslagen.


