Epistemic Core
      │
      ▼
RIP-334.4A
Cryptographic Provenance
      │
      ├── Ed25519 signing
      ├── SHA-256 content digest
      ├── canonical encoding
      ├── key identifiers
      ├── key lifecycle
      ├── signature verification
      ├── historical verification
      ├── tamper detection
      └── property / compile tests
      │
      ▼
RIP-334.5
Persistent Evidence Ledger

Canonieke security boundary

┌──────────────────────────────┐
│       OBSERVATION            │
└──────────────┬───────────────┘
               │
               ▼
       canonical bytes
               │
               ▼
          SHA-256
               │
               ▼
      ContentDigest [32]
               │
               ▼
